dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.mesh.diff
version 1
schema stdio.semio.mesh
start body
framing record

# P2 mesh wave: REAL binary diff frame, replacing the old `print_diff().into_bytes()`
# text-as-binary shortcut (`🔺️diff/🦀️.rs`'s old `DiffCodec::encode_diff`). `format u8` +
# `presence u8` (bit0 = `meshes` present, bit1 = `materials` present, bit2 = `textures` present)
# are two REAL fixed fields; past that, 0-3 varint-length-prefixed opaque blobs follow (one per
# present collection) — modeled as one opaque trailing `payload` chain rather than per-segment
# `Cond`-guarded fields because a SECOND `if`-guard on a field that was itself only conditionally
# decoded hard-errors `eval_cond` (`protocol-cond-cannot-chain`, hit here for real — same gap
# `🌊️flow`'s own diff protocol documents). The real Rust `encode_diff`/`decode_diff` stays
# genuinely, fully structured (`write_str_lp`/`read_str_lp`, `store::pack_rt`'s real varint codec)
# — round-trip tested independently.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field presence u8

chain payload bytes
